Example:
    int: a 1
    int: b 2
    int: c 3
    int: d 4
    Square:
        Struct: [a b c] [a b d] [a b c d]
    Round:
        Struct: (a b c) (a b d) (a b c d)
    return: @
    run:
        return: (length(Square\Struct) length(Square\Struct[0]) length(Square\Struct[1]) length(Square\Struct[2]) Square\Struct[2]\[3] Round\Struct[2]\[3])
